This product bundles no third-party source. It depends at runtime on five packages,
all under permissive licences compatible with Apache-2.0 and each installed from its
own distribution rather than vendored here:

  duckdb            MIT
  fastapi           MIT
  uvicorn           BSD-3-Clause
  PyYAML            MIT
  python-multipart  Apache-2.0

The optional extraction stage in extract/ additionally depends on torch, transformers,
tokenizers and safetensors, none of which are installed by default and none of which
the served engine imports.

The data in data/raw/ is a public extract retrieved from the FFIEC HMDA Data Browser.
Home Mortgage Disclosure Act data is published by the United States government and is
not subject to copyright.
